871429.png/GEDMpE7JS1hb8BeH2W0BhDRquXnxziJL51zUxedc1MU\"/><figcaption>戰後最大的誘拐案「吉展ちゃん誘拐殺人事件」（01製圖／維基百科圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「Japaholic」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-07T11:15:16.868435+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2361,"images":25,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}